jx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.859ex\" height=\"1.57ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 3031.6 694\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1036.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2314.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 8 English Explanation 1\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m4wcwzmr/b3e89e17-016f-4456-a61c-ab2605dbb6f2/dcdcdb30-be99-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcwzms.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>(iii) It is an example of addition reaction to carbonyl group, where lithium aluminium hydride <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"8.813ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 3895.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"69\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-69\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\" transform=\"translate(903,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\" transform=\"translate(1653,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\" transform=\"translate(1931,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2714,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3506.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> adds hydrogen across carbon and oxygen of carbonyl group thus reducing it to an alcohol. Both R and S enantiomers will be formed. Hence, racemic mixture will be obtained as carbonyl carbon becomes chiral.</p>\n<p>(C) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> (P, Q)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m4wcysz9/548678d0-dfec-4d7e-b9e0-f7277e1075a8/0f578650-be9a-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcysza.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m4wcysz9/548678d0-dfec-4d7e-b9e0-f7277e1075a8/0f578650-be9a-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcysza.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Compounds Containing Nitrogen Question 8 English Explanation 2\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m4wcysz9/548678d0-dfec-4d7e-b9e0-f7277e1075a8/0f578650-be9a-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcysza.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m4wcysz9/548678d0-dfec-4d7e-b9e0-f7277e1075a8/0f578650-be9a-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcysza.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m4wcysz9/548678d0-dfec-4d7e-b9e0-f7277e1075a8/0f578650-be9a-11ef-add2-0b89a23f36fe/file-jaoe38c1m4wcysza.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1